{
  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 0.2,
      "end": 1.24,
      "text": "So AI just killed executive"
    },
    {
      "start": 1.24,
      "end": 1.82,
      "text": "assistants."
    },
    {
      "start": 2.2399999999999998,
      "end": 2.5,
      "text": "Well,"
    },
    {
      "start": 2.66,
      "end": 3.84,
      "text": "it killed their jobs anyway."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.92,
      "end": 4.5,
      "text": "You can now build a"
    },
    {
      "start": 4.5,
      "end": 5.82,
      "text": "personal AI OS that helps you"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.82,
      "end": 6.68,
      "text": "organize your tasks,"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.840000000000001,
      "end": 7.58,
      "text": "manage your calendar,"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.58,
      "end": 8.6,
      "text": "prepare for your appointments,"
    },
    {
      "start": 8.72,
      "end": 9.98,
      "text": "and keep important follow-ups from"
    },
    {
      "start": 9.98,
      "end": 10.6,
      "text": "disappearing."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.706667000000001,
      "end": 11.266667,
      "text": "So here's how."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.366667,
      "end": 12.166667,
      "text": "First, you just give it"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.166667,
      "end": 13.426667,
      "text": "context and instructions about who"
    },
    {
      "start": 13.426667,
      "end": 13.806667000000001,
      "text": "you are,"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.006667,
      "end": 14.486667,
      "text": "what you do,"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.486667,
      "end": 15.666667,
      "text": "and what you're responsible for."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.766667,
      "end": 16.846667,
      "text": "Then connect the tools where"
    },
    {
      "start": 16.846667,
      "end": 18.106666999999998,
      "text": "your tasks, your calendar,"
    },
    {
      "start": 18.306667,
      "end": 19.706667,
      "text": "your messages, and documents already"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.706667,
      "end": 20.086667,
      "text": "live."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.18,
      "end": 21.48,
      "text": "Finally, just give it workflows"
    },
    {
      "start": 21.48,
      "end": 22.38,
      "text": "for things like planning your"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.38,
      "end": 22.68,
      "text": "day,"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.88,
      "end": 23.779999999999998,
      "text": "prepping for meetings,"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.78,
      "end": 24.7,
      "text": "tracking follow-ups,"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.86,
      "end": 25.52,
      "text": "things like that."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.62,
      "end": 26.3,
      "text": "And now you can tell"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.3,
      "end": 27.06,
      "text": "it what you need in"
    },
    {
      "start": 27.06,
      "end": 28.16,
      "text": "plain English and get help"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.16,
      "end": 29.22,
      "text": "based on your actual work"
    },
    {
      "start": 29.22,
      "end": 30.5,
      "text": "instead of another generic answer"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.5,
      "end": 31.54,
      "text": "from an AI chatbot."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.653333,
      "end": 32.353333,
      "text": "It doesn't need"
    },
    {
      "start": 32.433333,
      "end": 33.053332999999995,
      "text": "to take a break,"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.253333,
      "end": 34.293333,
      "text": "and it never forgets anything."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.413332999999994,
      "end": 34.873332999999995,
      "text": "So if you'd like to"
    },
    {
      "start": 34.873332999999995,
      "end": 35.793333,
      "text": "build your own AI OS,"
    },
    {
      "start": 35.793333,
      "end": 36.553332999999995,
      "text": "then click below to learn"
    },
    {
      "start": 36.553332999999995,
      "end": 36.853333,
      "text": "more."
    }
